<title>USA: US DLA sets date for monthly tin sales.</title>
<headline>US DLA sets date for monthly tin sales.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense Logistics Agency said Thursday that it will hold its monthly tin sale the first Wednesday of every month. DLA said the first monthly sale will be held November 6.</p>
<p>DLA said it will offer up to 200 tonnes of stockpile tin at its monthly sales in fiscal 1997 which began October 1.</p>
<p>DLA ended its daily tin sales on September 30.</p>
</text>
